      "message": "Hi Tim,\n\nFrom Eric checked and my checked : EC not defined the `CONFIG_TABLET_MODE`, so it will not store tablet mode status in share memory for host read. And from my test, I did not see OS icon change to tablet mode when body detection was trigger.\n\n```\n\t\tcase EC_ACPI_MEM_DEVICE_ORIENTATION:\n\t\t\tresult \u003d 0;\n\n#ifdef CONFIG_TABLET_MODE\n\t\t\tresult \u003d tablet_get_mode() \u003c\u003c EC_ACPI_MEM_TBMD_SHIFT;\n#endif\n```",
